1
00:01:42,670 --> 00:01:48,009
[When I Meet The Moon]

2
00:01:48,090 --> 00:01:51,050
[Episode 23]

3
00:01:57,370 --> 00:01:58,450
Where is your dad?

4
00:02:00,940 --> 00:02:02,140
He went back to Xifu.

5
00:02:12,470 --> 00:02:13,280
Fu Shize.

6
00:02:14,900 --> 00:02:15,840
Sorry.

7
00:02:17,180 --> 00:02:18,710
My dad has a bad temper.

8
00:02:19,410 --> 00:02:21,370
His way of thinking
is way too conservative.

9
00:02:21,370 --> 00:02:23,130
He just wants me to stay in Xifu.

10
00:02:23,930 --> 00:02:25,500
He shouldn't have treated you like that.

11
00:02:25,500 --> 00:02:26,579
It was too rude.

12
00:02:33,579 --> 00:02:34,340
It's okay.

13
00:02:35,970 --> 00:02:37,770
You don't need to worry about me.

14
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:41,570
Actually, you didn't have to

15
00:02:41,910 --> 00:02:43,710
tell him about your suspension.

16
00:02:44,250 --> 00:02:45,980
Others may not understand you,

17
00:02:46,240 --> 00:02:47,280
but in my eyes,

18
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:49,520
you are the absolute best.

19
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,130
I...

20
00:02:50,780 --> 00:02:52,280
I have seen you shine.

21
00:02:54,480 --> 00:02:58,140
♪ Dust upon time ♪

22
00:02:56,090 --> 00:02:57,360
I hope to see you

23
00:02:57,360 --> 00:02:58,530
like that again.

24
00:02:58,970 --> 00:03:01,530
♪ Every step soft and slow ♪

25
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:06,520
♪ The room holds my profile ♪

26
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:06,150
Don't you have anything

27
00:03:06,150 --> 00:03:07,250
you want to say?

28
00:03:07,450 --> 00:03:10,840
♪ Passing no verdict for anyone ♪

29
00:03:11,090 --> 00:03:12,630
You want me to go back to XUST

30
00:03:11,770 --> 00:03:15,790
♪ Wind brushes the half-drawn curtain ♪

31
00:03:16,190 --> 00:03:19,840
♪ Carrying away unneeded words ♪

32
00:03:16,430 --> 00:03:18,030
and return to how I used to be.

33
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,120
Yeah.

34
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:24,329
♪ Is it true that the more we wish
for what we want ♪

35
00:03:24,350 --> 00:03:28,590
♪ The more we tend to fall short? ♪

36
00:03:28,890 --> 00:03:33,090
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

37
00:03:33,270 --> 00:03:36,840
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

38
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:34,860
I understand.

39
00:03:37,450 --> 00:03:41,340
♪ Does the fading light ♪

40
00:03:41,370 --> 00:03:45,420
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

41
00:03:46,200 --> 00:03:50,240
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

42
00:03:49,590 --> 00:03:50,400
Fu Shize.

43
00:03:50,260 --> 00:03:54,020
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

44
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:52,800
Don't you think

45
00:03:53,460 --> 00:03:55,150
there are many problems

46
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:58,520
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

47
00:03:56,300 --> 00:03:57,800
with our communication?

48
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:02,960
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

49
00:04:00,500 --> 00:04:02,560
There is a lot about your past

50
00:04:02,740 --> 00:04:03,590
that you don't want to talk about,

51
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:04,590
and I won't ask you to.

52
00:04:04,260 --> 00:04:09,350
♪ Half the tale remains ♪

53
00:04:11,630 --> 00:04:13,900
I originally fantasized that

54
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:15,750
if I became your girlfriend,

55
00:04:16,390 --> 00:04:17,360
you might one day

56
00:04:17,360 --> 00:04:19,430
be willing to tell me on your own.

57
00:04:24,660 --> 00:04:25,930
I feel now

58
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,130
that it's just

59
00:04:28,160 --> 00:04:31,130
my wishful thinking.

60
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:36,800
Look at you.

61
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:37,830
You're doing it right now.

62
00:04:37,830 --> 00:04:40,230
Y-You're just staying completely silent.

63
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:41,250
It's the case with

64
00:04:41,250 --> 00:04:42,980
that locked room of yours, too.

65
00:04:43,250 --> 00:04:44,250
You never explain

66
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:45,540
anything to me.

67
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:51,990
My advisor asked me
to go abroad for an exchange.

68
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:53,860
This is indeed

69
00:04:53,860 --> 00:04:55,590
a very good opportunity for me.

70
00:04:56,890 --> 00:04:58,130
But because this opportunity

71
00:04:58,130 --> 00:05:00,240
would take me very far away from you,

72
00:05:00,500 --> 00:05:01,660
I chose to stay.

73
00:05:01,660 --> 00:05:03,100
I'm willing to stay.

74
00:05:03,440 --> 00:05:04,930
How I wish we

75
00:05:05,530 --> 00:05:07,230
could be happy together.

76
00:05:08,630 --> 00:05:09,430
But you?

77
00:05:10,430 --> 00:05:11,600
You just keep your secrets

78
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,800
and tell me nothing.

79
00:05:14,100 --> 00:05:14,870
Why do you

80
00:05:14,900 --> 00:05:16,490
always shut me out?

81
00:05:18,800 --> 00:05:20,390
No matter how hard I try,

82
00:05:20,890 --> 00:05:22,060
I always feel like I'm looking at you

83
00:05:22,060 --> 00:05:23,600
through a layer of fog.

84
00:05:23,600 --> 00:05:24,390
I... I can't

85
00:05:24,390 --> 00:05:25,920
walk into your heart.

86
00:05:25,110 --> 00:05:27,210
♪ Half my clinging stays ♪

87
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:29,010
♪ Half this world ♪

88
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:32,510
♪ Both form something brand-new ♪

89
00:05:29,860 --> 00:05:30,660
It's as if

90
00:05:31,430 --> 00:05:32,950
my existence

91
00:05:33,290 --> 00:05:35,510
♪ You leave your words half-spoken ♪

92
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:34,130
is dispensable

93
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:35,300
to you.

94
00:05:35,300 --> 00:05:35,930
I...

95
00:05:35,850 --> 00:05:37,760
♪ Another half are lost ♪

96
00:05:36,190 --> 00:05:37,860
You don't need me to share

97
00:05:37,790 --> 00:05:41,520
♪ Where can I peek for the rest? ♪

98
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:39,790
or participate in your life at all.

99
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:43,870
♪ Half drifting apart ♪

100
00:05:44,220 --> 00:05:46,220
♪ Half a hug we share ♪

101
00:05:46,250 --> 00:05:49,909
♪ A goodnight too late ♪

102
00:05:49,990 --> 00:05:52,190
♪ Let the moon be half-lit ♪

103
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:54,810
♪ Clouds half-hidden too ♪

104
00:05:56,159 --> 00:06:03,920
♪ Let me brave once more ♪

105
00:06:32,650 --> 00:06:33,659
Why are you so quiet?

106
00:06:33,659 --> 00:06:35,260
Are you a ghost, Fu Zhengchu?

107
00:06:35,740 --> 00:06:36,460
You've been looking at it for a while.

108
00:06:36,460 --> 00:06:37,390
Have some water.

109
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:38,360
I don't want any.

110
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,240
Then have some later.

111
00:06:42,450 --> 00:06:43,780
What are you looking at?

112
00:06:47,610 --> 00:06:48,730
Our professor recommended

113
00:06:48,730 --> 00:06:49,960
that I intern at this hotel

114
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:51,490
to study hotel management.

115
00:06:51,540 --> 00:06:52,930
It looks very high-end.

116
00:06:53,130 --> 00:06:53,720
Is it far?

117
00:06:55,560 --> 00:06:57,340
Then, as a family member,

118
00:06:57,700 --> 00:06:59,100
do I get a staff discount?

119
00:06:59,650 --> 00:07:00,510
It's very far.

120
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,770
How far can it be?

121
00:07:01,950 --> 00:07:03,310
Hainan? Beijing?

122
00:07:03,340 --> 00:07:03,930
It's fine.

123
00:07:03,930 --> 00:07:04,840
At worst, I'll fly a few more times

124
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:05,690
to visit you.

125
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:06,480
London.

126
00:07:08,250 --> 00:07:09,000
London...

127
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,640
That is indeed quite far...

128
00:07:10,660 --> 00:07:11,470
London?

129
00:07:11,930 --> 00:07:13,130
You're going abroad?

130
00:07:13,250 --> 00:07:13,830
Yes.

131
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,890
Then wouldn't we be
in a long-distance relationship?

132
00:07:16,890 --> 00:07:17,930
Is there a problem?

133
00:07:17,930 --> 00:07:19,430
Of course there is.

134
00:07:20,860 --> 00:07:22,320
Have you decided already?

135
00:07:22,630 --> 00:07:24,090
I'm still considering it.

136
00:07:28,220 --> 00:07:28,860
Tang Lin,

137
00:07:29,450 --> 00:07:30,910
you don't love me anymore.

138
00:07:33,670 --> 00:07:35,040
Are you crazy?

139
00:07:35,540 --> 00:07:36,740
I'm going abroad for an internship,

140
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:38,140
not breaking up with you.

141
00:07:38,420 --> 00:07:39,810
Don't make a fuss.

142
00:07:40,159 --> 00:07:41,360
Then I'll go with you.

143
00:07:41,430 --> 00:07:42,240
No need.

144
00:07:42,540 --> 00:07:43,470
Why would you go?

145
00:07:43,500 --> 00:07:44,750
I'm going with Lili.

146
00:07:44,750 --> 00:07:46,550
Just be good and wait for me here.

147
00:08:42,340 --> 00:08:43,549
Except for the second floor,
which I couldn't enter,

148
00:08:43,549 --> 00:08:44,290
I wiped

149
00:08:44,290 --> 00:08:45,390
everywhere else.

150
00:08:47,740 --> 00:08:48,530
I'm sorry.

151
00:08:48,740 --> 00:08:50,870
I-I shouldn't have taken the liberty.

152
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,430
I'll handle the tidying up

153
00:08:56,730 --> 00:08:57,600
from now on.

154
00:09:01,200 --> 00:09:04,120
Jiang Zhou?

155
00:09:05,100 --> 00:09:06,620
Jiang Yuan?

156
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:09,470
♪ The dusk settles slow ♪

157
00:09:07,650 --> 00:09:08,620
I'm sorry, Lili.

158
00:09:09,500 --> 00:09:12,510
♪ Too faint of heart to follow through ♪

159
00:09:11,000 --> 00:09:11,800
I...

160
00:09:14,680 --> 00:09:16,680
♪ It's grown like a habit ♪

161
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:16,700
I'm not ready to talk about it yet.

162
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:19,700
♪ Awaiting dark clouds to spread ♪

163
00:09:19,670 --> 00:09:21,270
I'll tell you when I'm ready.

164
00:09:21,930 --> 00:09:24,090
♪ Fear promises are shallow ♪

165
00:09:22,980 --> 00:09:23,770
Okay?

166
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:27,580
♪ No match for the tides of change ♪

167
00:09:29,190 --> 00:09:33,600
♪ Let rain soak all that once was ours ♪

168
00:09:36,410 --> 00:09:38,770
♪ Lingering right here ♪

169
00:09:39,030 --> 00:09:40,540
♪ Who tries to talk me down? ♪

170
00:09:40,580 --> 00:09:42,400
♪ Who makes excuses now? ♪

171
00:09:42,430 --> 00:09:45,370
♪ Let memories trail in threads ♪

172
00:09:46,030 --> 00:09:49,080
♪ Too shattered to pick up ♪

173
00:09:50,960 --> 00:09:54,320
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

174
00:09:54,530 --> 00:09:57,560
♪ Willingly I wait ♪

175
00:09:57,920 --> 00:10:02,790
♪ To soothe the sorry I said yesterday ♪

176
00:10:03,380 --> 00:10:05,350
♪ Half a phrase unspoken ♪

177
00:10:05,370 --> 00:10:08,630
♪ Always too late ♪

178
00:10:08,650 --> 00:10:11,110
♪ Time freezes still ♪

179
00:10:11,650 --> 00:10:14,170
♪ My care burns hot ♪

180
00:10:14,330 --> 00:10:17,740
♪ Hidden from your sight ♪

181
00:10:31,020 --> 00:10:32,840
♪ A thin short line ♪

182
00:10:32,860 --> 00:10:36,480
♪ Two hearts intertwined ♪

183
00:10:38,210 --> 00:10:40,210
♪ Which way to go ♪

184
00:10:40,500 --> 00:10:43,480
♪ Might be simpler so ♪

185
00:10:45,510 --> 00:10:47,270
♪ Some wait for an umbrella ♪

186
00:10:47,290 --> 00:10:51,290
♪ Some wait for the sun to show ♪

187
00:10:52,350 --> 00:10:57,650
♪ Hesitant feet—which side
should I stand on ♪

188
00:10:59,970 --> 00:11:02,650
♪ The cold pale moon ♪

189
00:11:02,670 --> 00:11:04,260
♪ Never touching the ground ♪

190
00:11:04,280 --> 00:11:06,090
♪ Far too out of reach ♪

191
00:11:06,110 --> 00:11:09,090
♪ This damp murmur ♪

192
00:11:09,380 --> 00:11:13,840
♪ Loud as it is, unheard ♪

193
00:11:14,490 --> 00:11:17,840
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

194
00:11:18,030 --> 00:11:21,010
♪ Resentment takes root inside ♪

195
00:11:21,670 --> 00:11:27,100
♪ Rain falls, and grief runs aground ♪

196
00:11:27,130 --> 00:11:28,900
♪ Nothing but remembrance ♪

197
00:11:29,790 --> 00:11:32,780
♪ Always too late ♪

198
00:11:32,800 --> 00:11:35,040
♪ My regrets are too obvious ♪

199
00:11:35,210 --> 00:11:37,610
♪ Drowning the whole world ♪

200
00:11:37,640 --> 00:11:42,590
♪ But you always understand ♪

201
00:12:12,850 --> 00:12:16,070
♪ Afraid it's too late ♪

202
00:12:16,090 --> 00:12:19,570
♪ For me to keep my promise ♪

203
00:12:19,820 --> 00:12:24,910
♪ Let debts bid farewell to unease ♪

204
00:12:25,270 --> 00:12:27,270
♪ We drift apart, each on our way ♪

205
00:12:27,300 --> 00:12:30,470
♪ Maybe someday ♪

206
00:12:30,490 --> 00:12:33,330
♪ Longing finds its way ♪

207
00:12:33,410 --> 00:12:40,010
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

208
00:12:40,080 --> 00:12:50,760
♪ I hope you write
the ending of our tale ♪

209
00:13:14,580 --> 00:13:15,440
Where's Yun Li?

210
00:13:18,010 --> 00:13:19,220
Did you come alone?

211
00:13:19,820 --> 00:13:21,680
I thought she would come with you.

212
00:13:23,580 --> 00:13:24,390
Not bad.

213
00:13:24,870 --> 00:13:26,110
I didn't expect her to give you

214
00:13:26,110 --> 00:13:26,850
break days

215
00:13:26,870 --> 00:13:28,470
during the honeymoon phase.

216
00:13:39,550 --> 00:13:40,360
What?

217
00:13:41,220 --> 00:13:42,150
Had an argument?

218
00:13:49,120 --> 00:13:50,580
I really can't imagine it.

219
00:13:51,010 --> 00:13:52,250
How did Yun Li manage to have an argument

220
00:13:52,250 --> 00:13:53,980
with a man of few words like you?

221
00:13:55,410 --> 00:13:56,980
Do you think the old me

222
00:14:00,860 --> 00:14:02,520
is better than the current me?

223
00:14:03,580 --> 00:14:03,960
What?

224
00:14:03,990 --> 00:14:05,750
Why are you asking that
in the middle of the night?

225
00:14:05,750 --> 00:14:07,340
What old and current you?

226
00:14:10,320 --> 00:14:11,910
The old me was better.

227
00:14:16,050 --> 00:14:18,910
Is there a difference between the old you

228
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:21,450
and the current you?

229
00:14:24,180 --> 00:14:25,320
To me,

230
00:14:27,150 --> 00:14:27,790
there is.

231
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:31,950
To her,

232
00:14:37,390 --> 00:14:38,200
there is too.

233
00:14:45,290 --> 00:14:45,910
Then...

234
00:14:46,170 --> 00:14:47,270
What do you think?

235
00:14:48,460 --> 00:14:50,060
I feel like I've let her down.

236
00:14:52,550 --> 00:14:53,740
The current me

237
00:14:58,670 --> 00:15:00,200
is not the person she likes.

238
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:07,170
You're up, Lili.

239
00:16:08,390 --> 00:16:09,850
I've prepared breakfast.

240
00:16:09,860 --> 00:16:10,670
Come and eat.

241
00:16:32,310 --> 00:16:33,360
There's an emergency at home.

242
00:16:33,360 --> 00:16:34,560
I'll be away for a bit.

243
00:17:14,260 --> 00:17:16,720
Shize, you're awake.

244
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:19,069
Grandma.

245
00:17:22,569 --> 00:17:24,369
Grandma, why are you getting up?

246
00:17:24,730 --> 00:17:25,420
Are you feeling unwell?

247
00:17:25,420 --> 00:17:26,500
I'm fine.

248
00:17:26,530 --> 00:17:27,730
I'm all better.

249
00:17:28,790 --> 00:17:30,380
I'm going on a trip.

250
00:17:31,060 --> 00:17:31,710
Grandma.

251
00:17:32,740 --> 00:17:33,880
Where are you going?

252
00:17:35,600 --> 00:17:36,890
I'll go with you.

253
00:17:37,330 --> 00:17:38,070
No need.

254
00:17:38,790 --> 00:17:40,580
Yuan will take me.

255
00:17:44,140 --> 00:17:45,100
He said

256
00:17:45,450 --> 00:17:46,910
that since spring is here,

257
00:17:46,980 --> 00:17:48,580
we can go mountain climbing.

258
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:50,340
When summer comes,

259
00:17:50,550 --> 00:17:52,770
I want to see the grasslands.

260
00:17:53,900 --> 00:17:56,400
I've never been to the grasslands.

261
00:17:57,740 --> 00:17:59,590
Just thinking about it

262
00:17:59,740 --> 00:18:00,940
makes me so happy.

263
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:07,880
Then when will you come back?

264
00:18:09,460 --> 00:18:10,550
I don't know.

265
00:18:11,400 --> 00:18:12,640
If I'm going to visit

266
00:18:12,980 --> 00:18:14,630
all these places,

267
00:18:14,750 --> 00:18:17,810
I'm afraid it will take a long, long time.

268
00:18:18,380 --> 00:18:20,960
I might not come back at all.

269
00:18:26,230 --> 00:18:27,970
What if I miss you?

270
00:18:30,810 --> 00:18:32,510
Whenever you miss me,

271
00:18:32,810 --> 00:18:35,350
I will know.

272
00:18:37,920 --> 00:18:38,920
I'll go with you.

273
00:18:41,310 --> 00:18:42,660
That won't do.

274
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:45,110
Shize, you're

275
00:18:45,110 --> 00:18:46,480
still so young.

276
00:18:46,970 --> 00:18:48,500
You need to stay here

277
00:18:48,850 --> 00:18:51,380
and find lots and lots of happiness.

278
00:18:51,970 --> 00:18:53,060
Only when I see

279
00:18:53,080 --> 00:18:54,640
that you are happy,

280
00:18:54,750 --> 00:18:56,310
can I rest assured.

281
00:18:58,750 --> 00:18:59,550
Grandma.

282
00:19:03,500 --> 00:19:05,200
Can you not leave?

283
00:19:08,180 --> 00:19:09,510
I can't bear to lose you.

284
00:19:11,770 --> 00:19:12,620
Shize.

285
00:19:14,120 --> 00:19:15,560
You have to look forward.

286
00:19:16,770 --> 00:19:18,920
Don't keep dwelling on the past.

287
00:19:21,010 --> 00:19:23,220
As long as you believe it in your heart,

288
00:19:23,720 --> 00:19:26,310
your dream will continue.

289
00:19:27,940 --> 00:19:31,890
I will become the clouds in the sky,

290
00:19:32,620 --> 00:19:35,320
the stars, and the wind,

291
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:38,220
to always be with you.

292
00:19:39,900 --> 00:19:41,460
As long as you feel it,

293
00:19:41,920 --> 00:19:44,270
I will be there.

294
00:19:57,020 --> 00:19:57,870
Shize.

295
00:19:59,350 --> 00:20:00,770
I have to go now.

296
00:20:01,610 --> 00:20:03,700
Yuan is waiting for me.

297
00:20:10,330 --> 00:20:11,300
I'm leaving now.

298
00:20:13,390 --> 00:20:14,120
I'm leaving.

299
00:20:15,850 --> 00:20:16,640
Grandma.

300
00:20:19,160 --> 00:20:20,010
Don't go.

301
00:20:22,070 --> 00:20:22,900
Don't go...

302
00:20:53,380 --> 00:20:56,250
Grandma, Grandma.

303
00:20:56,790 --> 00:20:59,640
Grandma, Grandma.

304
00:21:02,830 --> 00:21:03,810
Grandma...

305
00:21:24,350 --> 00:21:25,070
Grandma...

306
00:21:28,460 --> 00:21:29,590
Have a safe journey.

307
00:22:01,420 --> 00:22:04,370
[Tomb of Beloved Son Jiang Yuan]

308
00:22:38,310 --> 00:22:38,940
Yuan.

309
00:22:46,530 --> 00:22:47,830
Grandma is gone.

310
00:22:53,740 --> 00:22:55,670
Now I only have Lili left.

311
00:22:58,950 --> 00:22:59,790
I think...

312
00:23:00,630 --> 00:23:03,800
You're different from how you used to be.

313
00:23:04,310 --> 00:23:05,110
I just think

314
00:23:05,110 --> 00:23:07,250
the old you, who was so confident

315
00:23:07,770 --> 00:23:09,050
and radiant,

316
00:23:09,220 --> 00:23:10,460
looked really great.

317
00:23:11,920 --> 00:23:13,500
I've seen you shine.

318
00:23:16,980 --> 00:23:18,270
I hope to see you

319
00:23:18,270 --> 00:23:19,380
like that again.

320
00:23:24,770 --> 00:23:26,160
But what she likes

321
00:23:28,070 --> 00:23:28,960
and wants

322
00:23:34,110 --> 00:23:35,680
is the me from 7 years ago.

323
00:23:43,270 --> 00:23:43,810
Yuan.

324
00:23:48,000 --> 00:23:49,250
I don't dare tell her

325
00:23:51,410 --> 00:23:52,540
that Fu Shize

326
00:23:56,900 --> 00:23:58,070
is already gone.

327
00:24:05,330 --> 00:24:06,740
I can never go back.

328
00:24:42,730 --> 00:24:45,520
[Sip Slow Stay Lazy Homestay]

329
00:24:54,770 --> 00:24:56,640
Look at how listless you are.

330
00:24:56,740 --> 00:24:58,940
He must've not replied to your message.

331
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:03,140
No matter how busy he is with work,

332
00:25:03,140 --> 00:25:04,030
he should at least have time

333
00:25:04,030 --> 00:25:05,230
to reply to a message.

334
00:25:05,360 --> 00:25:06,160
Besides,

335
00:25:06,190 --> 00:25:07,170
isn't it normal

336
00:25:07,190 --> 00:25:08,800
to argue when you're dating?

337
00:25:08,860 --> 00:25:10,300
He stops replying
after a little argument...

338
00:25:10,300 --> 00:25:12,430
Isn't that just the silent treatment?

339
00:25:14,010 --> 00:25:15,010
What do you think?

340
00:25:18,940 --> 00:25:22,000
Are you going to keep waiting
for him to come back to you?

341
00:25:26,070 --> 00:25:29,330
I'll just treat it as us giving each other

342
00:25:29,330 --> 00:25:31,350
some space.

343
00:25:35,140 --> 00:25:38,070
Perhaps this kind of halftime break

344
00:25:38,740 --> 00:25:41,240
can make us stop

345
00:25:41,400 --> 00:25:42,880
and think things through.

346
00:25:45,700 --> 00:25:46,570
Didn't your advisor previously

347
00:25:46,570 --> 00:25:48,270
recommend that you study abroad?

348
00:25:48,270 --> 00:25:49,600
Have you considered it?

349
00:25:51,030 --> 00:25:51,900
I haven't

350
00:25:51,900 --> 00:25:53,760
seriously considered it before.

351
00:25:55,070 --> 00:25:56,090
The teachers in our department

352
00:25:56,090 --> 00:25:57,090
also want me to go

353
00:25:57,140 --> 00:25:58,750
to a hotel in the UK for an internship.

354
00:25:58,750 --> 00:26:00,100
If you also go to the UK,

355
00:26:00,130 --> 00:26:01,860
we can keep each other company.

356
00:26:03,140 --> 00:26:04,570
Let me think about it.

357
00:26:06,290 --> 00:26:07,530
When you feel better,

358
00:26:07,530 --> 00:26:08,940
give it some serious thought.

359
00:26:08,940 --> 00:26:10,340
It's a rare opportunity.

360
00:26:18,820 --> 00:26:19,640
Hello, Mom.

361
00:26:19,670 --> 00:26:20,200
Lili,

362
00:26:20,200 --> 00:26:21,400
y-your brother started having a fever

363
00:26:21,400 --> 00:26:22,070
last night.

364
00:26:22,070 --> 00:26:23,200
It's 39 degrees now.

365
00:26:23,290 --> 00:26:24,240
He's already starting

366
00:26:24,240 --> 00:26:25,140
to talk nonsense because of his fever.

367
00:26:25,140 --> 00:26:26,380
What should we do?

368
00:26:26,530 --> 00:26:28,930
He needs to go to the hospital
for an IV drip.

369
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:29,810
I have to go.

370
00:26:30,250 --> 00:26:31,200
Your dad is back.

371
00:26:31,220 --> 00:26:32,220
We're taking your brother

372
00:26:32,220 --> 00:26:33,350
to the hospital now.

373
00:26:34,480 --> 00:26:35,530
Mom, don't worry.

374
00:26:35,530 --> 00:26:36,180
If anything happens,

375
00:26:36,180 --> 00:26:37,580
let me know immediately.

376
00:26:37,890 --> 00:26:38,670
Got it.

377
00:26:38,690 --> 00:26:39,840
I'll hang up now.

378
00:26:43,200 --> 00:26:44,030
Don't worry.

379
00:26:44,070 --> 00:26:44,940
He'll be fine.

380
00:27:31,680 --> 00:27:32,940
Your brother is hospitalized.

381
00:27:32,940 --> 00:27:34,140
Come back right away.

382
00:27:38,910 --> 00:27:39,670
[Flight Ticket Schedule]

383
00:27:59,350 --> 00:28:00,550
Fu Shize.

384
00:28:02,050 --> 00:28:04,250
Why aren't you replying to my messages?

385
00:28:22,180 --> 00:28:23,360
Yun Ye is sick.

386
00:28:23,880 --> 00:28:25,480
I'm heading back to Xifu now.

387
00:28:51,030 --> 00:28:52,830
Can you come and keep me company?

388
00:29:46,180 --> 00:29:46,680
Dad.

389
00:29:47,250 --> 00:29:47,700
Dad.

390
00:29:47,770 --> 00:29:48,840
How is Yun Ye?

391
00:29:50,130 --> 00:29:51,200
He's inside.

392
00:29:51,220 --> 00:29:51,980
This way.

393
00:30:00,000 --> 00:30:02,090
I just signed a critical condition notice.

394
00:30:02,090 --> 00:30:03,270
The doctor said it's cholecystitis

395
00:30:03,270 --> 00:30:04,800
that turned into acute pancreatitis.

396
00:30:04,800 --> 00:30:06,780
They are determining
the surgical plan now.

397
00:30:06,780 --> 00:30:07,610
Once the plan is set,

398
00:30:07,610 --> 00:30:09,810
they'll arrange an emergency surgery.

399
00:30:16,900 --> 00:30:17,770
The hospital only allows one person

400
00:30:17,770 --> 00:30:19,200
to go in and accompany him.

401
00:30:19,200 --> 00:30:21,350
How did that suddenly happen to him?

402
00:30:33,380 --> 00:30:35,590
[Emergency]

403
00:30:44,600 --> 00:30:46,190
Shize, you're awake.

404
00:30:47,700 --> 00:30:48,290
What are you doing?

405
00:30:48,290 --> 00:30:48,680
Don't move.

406
00:30:48,680 --> 00:30:49,000
Don't move.

407
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:50,000
You're on an IV.

408
00:30:57,610 --> 00:30:58,140
Mom.

409
00:31:00,020 --> 00:31:00,940
What happened to me?

410
00:31:00,940 --> 00:31:02,540
You have a perforated ulcer.

411
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:05,460
I really don't know what to say to you.

412
00:31:06,080 --> 00:31:07,170
But it's okay.

413
00:31:07,200 --> 00:31:09,200
We've arranged everything for you.

414
00:31:10,720 --> 00:31:11,480
What do you want to do?

415
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:11,740
What are you doing?

416
00:31:11,740 --> 00:31:12,090
Don't move.

417
00:31:12,090 --> 00:31:12,960
Tell me, what do you want to do?

418
00:31:12,960 --> 00:31:13,570
Tell us.

419
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:15,680
Where's my phone?

420
00:31:16,080 --> 00:31:17,480
Okay, I'll get it for you.

421
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:22,980
Be careful.

422
00:31:32,240 --> 00:31:33,510
What are you doing? Don't sit up.

423
00:31:33,510 --> 00:31:33,940
What are you doing?

424
00:31:33,940 --> 00:31:35,180
What are you doing, my son?

425
00:31:35,180 --> 00:31:36,580
You're on an IV right now.

426
00:31:36,770 --> 00:31:37,740
What are you doing, Shize?

427
00:31:37,740 --> 00:31:38,810
Where are you going?

428
00:31:38,810 --> 00:31:39,700
Dad, Mom.

429
00:31:40,690 --> 00:31:41,570
I have an emergency.

430
00:31:41,570 --> 00:31:42,740
The surgery can wait a couple of days.

431
00:31:42,740 --> 00:31:43,980
No matter how urgent it is,

432
00:31:43,980 --> 00:31:45,640
wait until after the surgery
this afternoon.

433
00:31:45,640 --> 00:31:47,180
Do you have a death wish?

434
00:31:47,400 --> 00:31:47,830
Get up quickly.

435
00:31:47,830 --> 00:31:48,530
Go call the doctor.

436
00:31:48,530 --> 00:31:49,000
Okay.

437
00:31:49,000 --> 00:31:50,480
Son, Son!

438
00:31:50,910 --> 00:31:52,060
Are you okay?

439
00:31:52,090 --> 00:31:52,790
Son.

440
00:32:04,000 --> 00:32:05,770
Son, hang in there.

441
00:32:20,090 --> 00:32:21,350
You have hemorrhoids?

442
00:32:24,590 --> 00:32:25,400
It's fine.

443
00:32:25,400 --> 00:32:26,680
Kids your age

444
00:32:26,680 --> 00:32:27,530
sit on chairs all day

445
00:32:27,530 --> 00:32:28,570
and all night.

446
00:32:28,900 --> 00:32:31,030
It's normal to get these minor issues.

447
00:32:31,740 --> 00:32:33,330
Going to bed so early today?

448
00:32:33,330 --> 00:32:35,190
Why are you pretending to be good?

449
00:32:35,850 --> 00:32:36,960
My stomach hurts.

450
00:32:37,840 --> 00:32:38,700
I made some braised pork.

451
00:32:38,700 --> 00:32:39,630
It's in the fridge.

452
00:32:39,630 --> 00:32:41,500
If you're hungry, take it out and eat it.

453
00:32:41,500 --> 00:32:42,290
I'll pass.

454
00:32:42,400 --> 00:32:44,500
I felt nauseous after eating it last time.

455
00:32:44,500 --> 00:32:46,030
Something just felt wrong.

456
00:32:51,420 --> 00:32:53,700
Yun Ye told me long ago

457
00:32:53,940 --> 00:32:56,000
that his stomach was uncomfortable.

458
00:32:58,710 --> 00:33:01,570
As his sister,
I didn't even notice anything wrong.

459
00:33:02,810 --> 00:33:04,470
I'm a terrible sister.

460
00:33:11,720 --> 00:33:13,530
[Operating Room]

461
00:33:21,090 --> 00:33:21,890
Well...

462
00:33:22,180 --> 00:33:23,950
You should go home and rest first.

463
00:33:23,950 --> 00:33:25,440
Come back tomorrow after the surgery.

464
00:33:25,440 --> 00:33:26,000
Dad.

465
00:33:26,680 --> 00:33:27,680
You go back first.

466
00:33:28,230 --> 00:33:28,660
No.

467
00:33:28,830 --> 00:33:29,790
You're old.

468
00:33:29,790 --> 00:33:30,900
You can't handle staying up.

469
00:33:30,900 --> 00:33:32,030
Come, give me the stuff.

470
00:33:32,030 --> 00:33:33,530
I'll call you if anything happens.

471
00:33:33,530 --> 00:33:34,130
Off you go.

472
00:33:36,290 --> 00:33:37,010
Remember to call me.

473
00:33:37,010 --> 00:33:37,900
Sleep well.

474
00:33:56,710 --> 00:34:00,540
[Death rate of cholecystitis-induced
acute pancreatitis]

475
00:34:42,730 --> 00:34:44,320
Where did you go?

476
00:34:47,139 --> 00:34:48,850
When I need you the most,

477
00:34:49,900 --> 00:34:51,130
I can't even find you.

478
00:34:52,070 --> 00:34:52,880
Lili.

479
00:34:54,380 --> 00:34:55,170
Tangy.

480
00:34:57,510 --> 00:34:58,280
How is Yun Ye?

481
00:34:58,310 --> 00:34:59,270
Why are you here?

482
00:34:59,500 --> 00:35:01,010
I heard Yun Ye is having surgery,

483
00:35:01,010 --> 00:35:02,000
so I rushed over.

484
00:35:02,100 --> 00:35:02,880
Thank you.

485
00:35:04,070 --> 00:35:05,800
Why are you thanking me?

486
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:07,400
How is the situation now?

487
00:35:08,480 --> 00:35:10,880
He was issued a critical condition notice.

488
00:35:10,980 --> 00:35:12,000
That serious?

489
00:35:13,010 --> 00:35:14,900
But the surgery is already scheduled

490
00:35:14,900 --> 00:35:16,360
and his vitals are stable.

491
00:35:16,730 --> 00:35:17,650
He'll be fine.

492
00:35:21,260 --> 00:35:22,260
Where is Fu Shize?

493
00:35:24,530 --> 00:35:26,930
I... I haven't been able
to contact him yet.

494
00:35:27,500 --> 00:35:28,170
What's the point

495
00:35:28,170 --> 00:35:29,190
of having a boyfriend like this?

496
00:35:29,190 --> 00:35:30,190
When you need him the most,

497
00:35:30,190 --> 00:35:30,940
he's nowhere to be found.

498
00:35:30,940 --> 00:35:31,880
Is he going to wait until
the problem is solved

499
00:35:31,880 --> 00:35:32,940
before showing up?

500
00:35:34,710 --> 00:35:35,460
This won't do.

501
00:35:35,460 --> 00:35:36,360
I want to see

502
00:35:36,400 --> 00:35:38,190
what exactly he's busy with.

503
00:35:38,280 --> 00:35:39,480
I've already called.

504
00:35:39,880 --> 00:35:40,810
No one answered.

505
00:35:45,630 --> 00:35:46,630
Break up with him.

506
00:35:48,780 --> 00:35:50,300
When Yun Ye gets better,
break up with him.

507
00:35:50,300 --> 00:35:51,090
Then we'll go abroad

508
00:35:51,090 --> 00:35:52,220
and leave this jerk.

509
00:35:53,780 --> 00:35:54,710
Tangy.

510
00:35:55,190 --> 00:35:57,360
Don't say that.

511
00:35:58,610 --> 00:36:00,190
I'm just so mad.

512
00:36:02,670 --> 00:36:04,130
You haven't eaten, right?

513
00:36:04,400 --> 00:36:05,800
I'll go buy you some food.

514
00:36:16,300 --> 00:36:17,090
Thank you.

515
00:36:21,880 --> 00:36:23,480
Tang Lin, where did you go?

516
00:36:23,530 --> 00:36:24,730
Keep your voice down.

517
00:36:26,260 --> 00:36:27,170
I've been calling you all day,

518
00:36:27,170 --> 00:36:27,690
and you didn't answer.

519
00:36:27,690 --> 00:36:29,040
Where exactly did you go?

520
00:36:29,040 --> 00:36:30,640
I'm answering now, aren't I?

521
00:36:30,880 --> 00:36:32,070
I was on a plane earlier,

522
00:36:32,070 --> 00:36:32,730
so I couldn't answer.

523
00:36:32,730 --> 00:36:33,500
Plane?

524
00:36:35,500 --> 00:36:36,500
Did you go abroad?

525
00:36:36,980 --> 00:36:37,940
Did you just sneak out

526
00:36:37,940 --> 00:36:39,340
without even discussing it with me?

527
00:36:39,340 --> 00:36:40,740
What are you yelling for?

528
00:36:41,000 --> 00:36:42,460
Even if I didn't go abroad today,

529
00:36:42,460 --> 00:36:44,420
I'll go abroad in the future anyway.

530
00:36:44,420 --> 00:36:46,020
It has already been decided.

531
00:36:46,760 --> 00:36:48,600
And you didn't even discuss it with me?

532
00:36:48,600 --> 00:36:49,780
Aren't I your boyfriend?

533
00:36:49,780 --> 00:36:51,510
So what if you're my boyfriend?

534
00:36:51,800 --> 00:36:52,500
You men

535
00:36:52,500 --> 00:36:53,460
are all the same.

536
00:36:54,170 --> 00:36:56,030
No matter what our relationship is,

537
00:36:56,030 --> 00:36:57,570
I have to be myself first.

538
00:36:57,940 --> 00:36:58,730
It's my own choice.

539
00:36:58,730 --> 00:36:59,340
Why do I need to ask

540
00:36:59,340 --> 00:37:00,540
for your permission?

541
00:37:01,030 --> 00:37:01,500
I'm worried about

542
00:37:01,500 --> 00:37:03,300
your safety after you go abroad.

543
00:37:03,570 --> 00:37:05,170
What's there to worry about?

544
00:37:05,170 --> 00:37:06,400
Lili will be with me.

545
00:37:08,780 --> 00:37:09,350
Then,

546
00:37:10,610 --> 00:37:11,410
what about me?

547
00:37:17,780 --> 00:37:18,880
How would I know?

548
00:37:19,730 --> 00:37:20,190
I can only

549
00:37:20,190 --> 00:37:21,920
be responsible for my own life.

550
00:37:24,010 --> 00:37:24,550
Tang Lin.

551
00:37:24,960 --> 00:37:25,340
I know

552
00:37:25,340 --> 00:37:26,510
you haven't gone abroad yet.

553
00:37:26,510 --> 00:37:27,310
Where are you?

554
00:37:27,690 --> 00:37:28,750
I'll come find you.

555
00:37:29,570 --> 00:37:30,440
Don't come.

556
00:37:30,480 --> 00:37:31,940
I don't have time to see you right now.

557
00:37:31,940 --> 00:37:32,800
I'm hanging up.

558
00:37:44,680 --> 00:37:45,210
Oh my god,

559
00:37:45,580 --> 00:37:47,010
where did my handsome younger brother

560
00:37:47,010 --> 00:37:47,930
go?

561
00:37:49,300 --> 00:37:50,800
Look at your face,

562
00:37:50,800 --> 00:37:52,190
it's frowning like a bulldog.

563
00:37:52,190 --> 00:37:53,280
So ugly.

564
00:37:56,130 --> 00:37:56,840
Congsheng,

565
00:37:57,090 --> 00:37:58,290
stop making fun of me.

566
00:38:00,570 --> 00:38:01,900
What exactly happened?

567
00:38:05,190 --> 00:38:06,780
I'm heartbroken.

568
00:38:07,840 --> 00:38:09,280
What's the situation?

569
00:38:13,010 --> 00:38:14,150
Tangy and Lili

570
00:38:14,170 --> 00:38:15,600
are going abroad together.

571
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:16,540
They didn't even discuss it with me

572
00:38:16,540 --> 00:38:18,140
before making the decision.

573
00:38:18,440 --> 00:38:19,640
I've been abandoned.

574
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:20,570
Is it because

575
00:38:20,570 --> 00:38:22,200
you guys have been arguing lately,

576
00:38:22,200 --> 00:38:23,210
and she's just saying that

577
00:38:23,210 --> 00:38:24,520
out of anger?

578
00:38:26,480 --> 00:38:27,810
She's serious about it.

579
00:38:30,340 --> 00:38:31,880
You've only been together for a few days,

580
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:33,070
and now it's a long-distance relationship.

581
00:38:33,070 --> 00:38:34,500
That's really tough.

582
00:38:35,980 --> 00:38:37,900
Is there no room for negotiation?

583
00:38:40,560 --> 00:38:41,350
No.

584
00:38:41,860 --> 00:38:43,320
Her attitude is very firm.

585
00:38:47,730 --> 00:38:50,190
Why don't you call Uncle and ask?

586
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:52,700
Didn't they say Lili is going abroad too?

587
00:38:53,880 --> 00:38:54,480
Right.

588
00:39:01,990 --> 00:39:03,560
[Fu Zhengchu]

589
00:39:13,780 --> 00:39:14,280
Hello.

590
00:39:16,880 --> 00:39:17,690
Qingsong?

591
00:39:18,340 --> 00:39:19,200
Where's Uncle?

592
00:39:19,800 --> 00:39:21,130
What do you need him for?

593
00:39:21,940 --> 00:39:23,250
Tang Lin and Lili

594
00:39:23,280 --> 00:39:24,670
are going to study in the UK together.

595
00:39:24,670 --> 00:39:25,690
I want to ask Uncle

596
00:39:25,690 --> 00:39:27,440
if he knows what's going on.

597
00:39:30,510 --> 00:39:32,930
[No.1 Hospital of Xifu City]

598
00:39:37,190 --> 00:39:38,000
Hello.

599
00:39:38,090 --> 00:39:38,800
These are Yun Ye's

600
00:39:38,800 --> 00:39:39,980
pre-op test results.

601
00:39:39,980 --> 00:39:41,380
The blood test report isn't out yet.

602
00:39:41,380 --> 00:39:41,750
Okay,

603
00:39:41,780 --> 00:39:42,400
when it's out later,

604
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:43,570
bring it to me.

605
00:39:43,570 --> 00:39:44,300
Okay.

606
00:39:57,300 --> 00:39:58,380
Hello, Senior.

607
00:39:59,000 --> 00:39:59,590
Li,

608
00:39:59,590 --> 00:40:01,300
is there any news about Yun Ye lately?

609
00:40:01,300 --> 00:40:02,090
He used to send me

610
00:40:02,090 --> 00:40:02,880
a text message every day.

611
00:40:02,880 --> 00:40:04,170
He hasn't sent any recently,

612
00:40:04,170 --> 00:40:05,770
and I can't reach him either.

613
00:40:08,980 --> 00:40:10,500
Li, can you tell me?

614
00:40:10,500 --> 00:40:11,170
We agreed

615
00:40:11,170 --> 00:40:12,980
to meet up during the summer vacation.

616
00:40:12,980 --> 00:40:14,630
Did something happen to him?

617
00:40:17,670 --> 00:40:19,480
Yun Ye is sick.

618
00:40:20,530 --> 00:40:21,340
It's

619
00:40:22,370 --> 00:40:25,370
cholecystitis that turned
into acute pancreatitis.

620
00:40:29,510 --> 00:40:30,840
What happened to Yun Ye?

621
00:40:33,050 --> 00:40:34,090
Yun Ye is sick.

622
00:40:37,620 --> 00:40:38,380
Great-uncle.

623
00:40:38,380 --> 00:40:39,710
You're here, Qingsong.

624
00:40:40,510 --> 00:40:42,110
How is it? Is he doing better?

625
00:40:42,800 --> 00:40:43,590
A bit better.

626
00:40:45,720 --> 00:40:47,200
Why don't you go back and rest?

627
00:40:47,200 --> 00:40:48,200
I can stay here.

628
00:40:50,980 --> 00:40:51,780
That works.

629
00:40:52,100 --> 00:40:53,360
Call me if anything happens.

630
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:54,420
Okay, don't worry.

631
00:40:56,730 --> 00:40:57,630
Take good care of him.

632
00:40:57,630 --> 00:40:58,320
Take care.

633
00:41:12,260 --> 00:41:14,550
[Operating Room]

634
00:41:26,340 --> 00:41:27,070
Li.

635
00:41:28,150 --> 00:41:29,440
How is Yun Ye?

636
00:41:30,940 --> 00:41:32,400
He's in surgery.

637
00:41:40,030 --> 00:41:41,190
Keep Yunyi company.

638
00:41:41,190 --> 00:41:41,920
I'm fine.

639
00:42:10,670 --> 00:42:11,480
You're awake.

640
00:42:12,670 --> 00:42:13,820
How do you feel?

641
00:42:14,110 --> 00:42:15,440
Are you feeling better?

642
00:42:22,130 --> 00:42:23,130
Don't move.

643
00:42:23,400 --> 00:42:24,400
Where's my phone?

644
00:42:25,090 --> 00:42:26,230
Give me my phone.

645
00:42:27,340 --> 00:42:28,820
Here it is.

646
00:42:30,460 --> 00:42:31,280
Take it easy.

647
00:42:51,940 --> 00:42:52,530
Lili.

648
00:42:52,960 --> 00:42:54,710
I still have some things to do here.

649
00:42:54,710 --> 00:42:56,240
I'll go see you in a few days.

650
00:43:02,130 --> 00:43:03,720
Texting Yun Li again...

651
00:43:07,590 --> 00:43:08,280
Does she know

652
00:43:08,280 --> 00:43:09,500
about your surgery?

653
00:43:10,400 --> 00:43:11,190
No.

654
00:43:11,690 --> 00:43:12,840
Surgery is a big deal.

655
00:43:12,840 --> 00:43:14,230
Why didn't you tell her?

656
00:43:17,480 --> 00:43:19,000
I don't want her to worry.

657
00:43:21,880 --> 00:43:22,590
Shize.

658
00:43:23,390 --> 00:43:24,140
Some things

659
00:43:24,160 --> 00:43:25,640
just have to be said.

660
00:43:26,530 --> 00:43:27,100
I don't know

661
00:43:27,100 --> 00:43:28,660
what happened between you two.

662
00:43:28,660 --> 00:43:29,930
But Zhengchu told me

663
00:43:30,480 --> 00:43:32,510
that Yun Li is going to the UK.

664
00:43:38,670 --> 00:43:39,480
What?

665
00:43:40,780 --> 00:43:41,710
You didn't know?

666
00:43:45,280 --> 00:43:46,070
Shize.

667
00:43:46,910 --> 00:43:48,470
You changed so much for her,

668
00:43:49,090 --> 00:43:50,620
but now she's going abroad.

669
00:43:50,950 --> 00:43:52,610
Do you think it's all worth it?

670
00:44:03,900 --> 00:44:04,690
You...

671
00:44:09,020 --> 00:44:09,730
Don't move.

672
00:44:28,800 --> 00:44:29,900
Don't worry.

673
00:44:30,530 --> 00:44:31,590
The surgery went well.

674
00:44:31,590 --> 00:44:32,820
He'll recover soon.

675
00:44:37,840 --> 00:44:39,000
Get some rest.

676
00:44:39,480 --> 00:44:41,410
I'll go stay with Yunyi for a while.

677
00:44:42,030 --> 00:44:43,000
Thank you, Senior.
